OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 1 DEC
OL,4,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,5,     GIan Skelly plays the best in
OL,6,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,7,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,8,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,9,G1300FClassical Live
OL,10,     GHiroshi Amako and Michael Pandya
OL,11,     Gare live from Wigmore Hall,
OL,12,     GElizabeth Alker introduces a week
OL,13,     Gof great Romantic violin
OL,14,     Gconcertos and marks an
OL,15,     Ganniversary of EJ Moeran.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: John Rutter
OL,17,     GDonald Macleod speaks to John
OL,18,     GRutter about his extraordinary
OL,19,     Gmusical life in his 80th birthday
OL,20,     Gyear. Today, John shares memories
OL,21,     Gof his musical childhood in
OL,22,     GLondon.
